                <mxCell id="n1" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;reading this chart&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;padding-left:14px&quot;&gt;green: what the session does&lt;br&gt;yellow: the agent block, click to open&lt;br&gt;red: the run stops with an error&lt;br&gt;teal frame: the retry loop, one pass per failed run&lt;br&gt;grey text = the events sent out at that step&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2020" y="0" width="460" height="206" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n2" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;one run, two repairs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;padding-left:14px&quot;&gt;a too-long error → compact once (at most once per run)&lt;br&gt;a short failure → wait and retry (at most 3 times)&lt;br&gt;both end with continue_(), so the agent goes on where it stopped&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2020" y="246" width="460" height="206" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n3" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;not drawn here&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;padding-left:14px&quot;&gt;the hooks inside the agent run are on page 2a&lt;br&gt;saving: every message_end is saved right away, so a crash loses at most the message being written&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2020" y="492" width="460" height="160" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="x1" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Menlo;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;1 · a normal run&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;padding-left:14px&quot;&gt;prompt(&quot;now add tests&quot;) → get ready (first time) → no plugin answers&lt;br&gt;→ run the agent → last answer ok → the run ends&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2020" y="732" width="720" height="114" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="x2" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Menlo;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;2 · a 429 rate limit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;padding-left:14px&quot;&gt;last answer: error &quot;429 Too Many Requests&quot;&lt;br&gt;&quot;is an error?&quot; yes → &quot;too long?&quot; no → &quot;short failure?&quot; yes&lt;br&gt;→ auto_retry_start, wait 2s → continue_() → ok&lt;br&gt;→ &quot;the run ends&quot;: auto_retry_end (success)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2020" y="876" width="720" height="160" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="x3" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Menlo;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;3 · too long for the model&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;padding-left:14px&quot;&gt;last answer: error &quot;prompt is too long: 210000 tokens&quot;&lt;br&gt;&quot;too long?&quot; yes → compact once → continue_() → ok&lt;br&gt;a second &quot;too long&quot; in the same run → stop with the error&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2020" y="1066" width="720" height="137" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="x4" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dc2626;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Menlo;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;4 · Stop during the wait&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;padding-left:14px&quot;&gt;429 → wait 4s (attempt 2) → you press Stop&lt;br&gt;→ &quot;stop · aborted during the wait&quot; → auto_retry_end (no success)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2020" y="1233" width="720" height="114" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="x5" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dc2626;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Menlo;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;5 · a fatal error&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;padding-left:14px&quot;&gt;no API key: error_kind = fatal&lt;br&gt;&quot;short failure?&quot; no → &quot;stop with the error&quot;, no retry&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2020" y="1377" width="720" height="114" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="x6" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Menlo;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;6 · a plugin answers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;padding-left:14px&quot;&gt;prompt(&quot;/plan&quot;) → the plan_mode plugin handles it&lt;br&gt;→ &quot;stop · nothing runs&quot;: no model call at all&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2020" y="1521" width="720" height="114" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
